  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 is the stable release closure of the managed Icod.DCurses contract frozen by 0.9.0 and accepted through the green 1.0.0-rc.1 gate. The stable DCurses public and semantic contract remains machine-guarded at 43 exported types and 309 canonical contract lines; enum values, geometry, Unicode/cell semantics, lifetime, ownership, exception/cancellation behavior, nullable metadata, the approved Terminal/TermInfo public dependency boundary, documentation, and representative application acceptance remain unchanged from the accepted release candidate. After stable source closure, the direct Icod.Terminal package dependency was refreshed from 1.4.0 to 1.5.0 without changing the Icod.DCurses Version, PackageVersion, AssemblyVersion, or public API. Current dependencies are Icod.Terminal 1.5.0 and Icod.TermInfo 1.10.0.",
